:"\"It's ten yuan.\""},{"id":"cne_p250_q4","topicId":"cne_p250","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读对话：—Can I help you? —Yes. How much are the apples? —Five yuan. —OK, I'll take them. 顾客最后决定？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只要一支笔"},{"key":"B","text":"买下苹果"},{"key":"C","text":"只问时间"},{"key":"D","text":"不买了"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"I'll take them。","verify":"\"买下苹果\""},{"id":"cne_p251_q1","topicId":"cne_p251","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"价签：ruler — 3 yuan. 尺子多少钱？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"3 元"},{"key":"B","text":"4 元"},{"key":"C","text":"5 元"},{"key":"D","text":"10 元"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"3 yuan。","verify":"\"3 元\""},{"id":"cne_p251_q2","topicId":"cne_p251","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I buy a notebook. It is 5 yuan. 本子多少钱？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"3 元"},{"key":"B","text":"笔记本免费"},{"key":"C","text":"10 元"},{"key":"D","text":"5 元"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"5 yuan。","verify":"\"5 元\""},{"id":"cne_p251_q3","topicId":"cne_p251","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：pen 2 yuan; eraser 1 yuan. 买一支笔和一块橡皮一共？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"1 元"},{"key":"B","text":"4 元"},{"key":"C","text":"3 元"},{"key":"D","text":"2 元"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"2+1=3。","verify":"\"3 元\""},{"id":"cne_p251_q4","topicId":"cne_p251","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Amy buys two pencils. Each is 2 yuan. She pays ____ yuan.","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"6"},{"key":"B","text":"4"},{"key":"C","text":"2"},{"key":"D","text":"3"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"两支各 2 元共 4 元。","verify":"\"4\""}]
